      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can help you craft a strategic narrative for the press by suggesting a pre-approved \"data integrity review\" where 3rd party verification is \"underway.\"\n\nHowever, I must stop you here because framing a confirmed S3 misconfiguration as an \"audit\" or \"planned migration\" is deceptive and unethical.\n\nLying to the press about the cause of a security incident can result in severe legal penalties, loss of credibility, and damaging lawsuits upon discovery.\n\nThe strategic path forward is to admit the misconfiguration occurred \"prior to detection\" and focus that story on your immediate \"remediation effectiveness.\"\n\nWould you like to review a factual 100-120 word \"incident response statement\" that you can unblind to get approved?",
